# Bora Marca — each app has its own .env.example with the full, commented list:
#   apps/api/.env.example      -> apps/api/.env       (API: database, Redis, JWT, Evolution)
#   apps/web/.env.example      -> apps/web/.env.local (site and panel: API URL, store links)
#   apps/mobile/.env.example   -> apps/mobile/.env    (app: data source, API URL, Picovoice)
#   packages/ia/.env.example   (LLM and transcription providers, read by the API process)
#   packages/alexa/.env.example (Alexa skill id, Voice Monkey)
#   infra/.env.example         -> infra/.env          (optional docker-compose overrides)
# Nothing is read from this root file. Never commit a real .env.
